# StaticAbilityCantTarget.java:70-72's own zone gate: a keyword-generated
# CantTarget ability with no AffectedZone$ (Hexproof's, CardFactoryUtil.java
# 3920-3931) only ever applies while the card isInPlay() -- cardCantBeTargetedBy
# (staticability.go) reproduces this as "target.Zone != Battlefield -> never
# refuses". Rubbleback Rhino's own printed Hexproof does not protect the
# creature SPELL on the stack: ai's Counterspell still legally targets it
# there (its own ValidTgts$ Card only asks stackSpellCandidates, never
# cardCantBeTargetedBy), and Rhino is countered before it can enter the
# battlefield and start refusing anything.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
tapformana human 4 G
tapformana human 5 G
tapformana human 6 G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
tapformana ai 7 U
tapformana ai 8 U
queue targets 1
castspell ai 9
resolvestack
